  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM implementation - regional migration management component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Better Regional Migration Management (BRMM) Programme aims to harness the benefits of regular migration in line with the Global Compact on Migration (GCM) and Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) 10.7 (to facilitate orderly, safe and responsible migration and mobility of people). By supporting better-managed migration within the global south and along routes to the UK, it will also compliment wider HMG objectives on illegal migration, including those set out in the National Security Council&#x2019;s Illegal Migration Strategy (IMS).</narrative>
  </description>
